[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mDerived + snooze (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mComputed from tasks + now on each render, plus a per-task snoozedUntil so you can dismiss something for a day. No [39m
     [38;5;246mnotification entity, no sync bugs, dismissal still works.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Purely derived
     [38;5;246mSimplest possible: a function over tasks and the clock. No dismissal at all — an overdue task nags until you [39m
     [38;5;246mcomplete it or move the date. Fewest moving parts.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m Stored notification records
